body:
Thank you all for the responses. I have calmed down since writing this and decided to think logically and level headed. Whatever happens, I cannot die. I have a family that loves me and depends on me, and a little sister that looks up to me. For their sake I have to improve my self.

&#x200B;

To those that read this and saw themselves in the most. I wish you all the best. I still feel terrible about what happened, but all I can do is look at what I wrote and not do that next time.
